    Entry: 5 SMA crosses above 100 SMA (golden cross), only when flat.
    Exit: death cross (5 SMA crosses below 100 SMA) while in profit (close >= entry price),
          or trailing stop 4 ATR below the highest high since entry.
    Position size: fixed 1.0 (100% equity).
    """
    # Compute SMAs and ATR
    sma5 = ind.sma(hist.close, 5)
    sma100 = ind.sma(hist.close, 100)
